<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-primary sticky-top">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="#">U-LEP</a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav" aria-controls="navbarNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
            <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav">
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="#">Home</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/ulep/login">Login</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/ulep/register">Register</a>
                    </li>
                    
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section id="about-section" style="padding: 60px 20px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #3b82f6; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
            About ULEP
        </h2>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 25px;">
            <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
                <div style="font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">🎓</div>
                <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">University Network</h3>
                <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
                    ULEP ek exclusive platform hai jo peer-to-peer university students ko ek sath connect karta hai, taake campus ke andar hi trust ke sath deal ho sake.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
                <div style="font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">💰</div>
                <h3 style="color: #10b981; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Micro-Gigs & Earnings</h3>
                <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
                    Apne skills (coding, documentation, design, assignment help) ka use karke campus ke baki students ke chote tasks pure karo aur apni pocket money generate karo.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
                <div style="font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">⏳</div>
                <h3 style="color: #a855f7; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Time-Saving Delegation</h3>
                <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
                    Agar tumhare paas time nahi hai ya kisi subject mein dikkat hai, toh apna task yahan post karo aur dusre skilled student ki madad se apna time bachao.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section> 
    
    <section id="features-section" style="padding: 60px 20px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; color: #3b82f6; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
            How U-LEP Works
        </h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;">
            <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 30px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #334155; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                    <span style="font-size: 28px;">💰</span>
                    <h3 style="color: #10b981; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">How to Earn</h3>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
                        <div style="color: #10b981; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">1.</div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Browse Active Feed</h4>
                            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">Logged-in dashboard par jao aur campus ke students dwara dale gaye live micro-gigs ki list check karo.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
                        <div style="color: #10b981; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">2.</div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Pick & Claim a Task</h4>
                            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">Jo kaam tumhare skill set (coding, design, assignment help) se match kare, use select karke accept karo.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
                        <div style="color: #10b981; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">3.</div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Submit & Get Paid</h4>
                            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">Deadline ke andar work complete karke submit karo. Task approve hote hi payment direct tumhare wallet balance mein credit ho jayegi.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 30px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #334155; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                    <span style="font-size: 28px;">⏳</span>
                    <h3 style="color: #3b82f6; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">How to Post</h3>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
                        <div style="color: #3b82f6; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">1.</div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Fill Work Details</h4>
                            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">'Post a Task' panel mein jao aur poori work requirement detail mein likho (jaise topic, pages, code stack, aur instructions).</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
                        <div style="color: #3b82f6; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">2.</div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Set Budget & Payout</h4>
                            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">Aap is kaam ke liye samne wale student ko kitna paisa doge (Fix Budget Amount), woh set karo aur lock karke publish kar do.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
                        <div style="color: #3b82f6; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">3.</div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Review Submission</h4>
                            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">Skilled students tumhara kaam karke denge. Unka work material verify karo, aur satisfaction milte hi transaction release kar do.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-MrcW6ZMFYlzcLA8Nl+NtUVF0sA7MsXsP1UyJoMp4YLEuNSfAP+JcXn/tWtIaxVXM" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>
</html>